# Binary magic-byte fixtures for fetch-conversation-attachments.sh type
# detection. Mark them binary so `git diff` emits "Binary files differ" rather
# than leaking raw bytes (e.g. the 0xff JPEG marker, the 0x89 PNG marker) into
# the textual diff: the pr-validate `validate` job feeds that diff to a UTF-8
# .decode() that aborts on the first non-UTF-8 byte. (sample.unknown is plain
# text and intentionally left as-is.)
sample.png binary
sample.jpg binary
sample.gif binary
sample.webp binary
sample.pdf binary
sample.heic binary
